     {
      "title": "Dissolution",
      "description": "Measurement of the amount of drug substance dissolved in a dissolution apparatus 2 (paddle) according to Ph. Eur. 2.9.3, “Dissolution for Solid Dosage Forms” or USP <711>, “Dissolution” or JP 6.10, “Dissolution Test”."
