      "title": "(continued)",
      "description": "Follow as per Ph. Eur. / USP / JP requirements."
     },
     {
      "title": "Reference solution",
      "description": "Approximate Sakuramil is 0.25 mg/mL"
     },
     {
      "title": "Evaluation",
      "description": "Determine the absorbance of the test solutions using a suitable spectrophotometer. If the results are calculated with the reference solution, additionally determine the absorbance of the reference solution."
